SUMMARY:Test Drive Asheville’s Newest Work Oasis: Free Coworking at 7Acr
 es (1)
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nAre you tired of staring at the same four 
 walls and talking to your houseplants? Remote work has its perks\, but the
  isolation can get old quickly. It is time to reclaim your social and prof
 essional capital while getting some serious work done.\n\nAVL Digital Noma
 ds is heading to The Workspace at 7Acres for two free coworking days. This
  is the newest and most highly anticipated workspace in Asheville\, and ou
 r nomad community has an exclusive invite to test drive it.\n\n**The Headl
 ines**\nHere is what you can look forward to at your temporary headquarter
 s:\n\n* Limited-distraction\, dedicated desks to help you actually focus.\
 n* Powered raising and lowering desks so you can stretch your legs through
 out the day.\n* Multiple monitors and docking stations to maximize your pr
 oductivity.\n* Ergonomic chairs because your back deserves better than the
  kitchen stool.\n* Blazing fast 2gig WiFi that puts standard home internet
  to shame.\n\n**A Bigger Vision for a Life Well Lived**\nThis is not just 
 another office space with a gym next door. The Workspace is only the first
  phase of Seven Acres\, a community built around a much bigger idea. The f
 ounders believe that work\, play\, recovery\, and connection are all essen
 tial to a fulfilling life. Everything here is intentionally designed to ma
 ke each element better\, creating one cohesive community. You can learn al
 l about this vision during your visit.\n\n**The Logistics**\nThis event ma
 rks day ONE of two free coworking days. You are welcome to drop in for one
  day or join us for both. Plus\, make sure to stick around for a separate 
 social time at the end of the day on Thursday to celebrate\, unwind\, and 
 connect with fellow nomads. Register for day [TWO here](https://www.meetup
 .com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315274240/).\n\nCome build community\, upgr
 ade your workday\, and help each other thrive. We can't wait to see you th
 ere!\n\n**ADN Pirani Cups available**\nCelebrate our 5th anniversary with 
 our customized [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-bra
 nd-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz s
 izes\, you can purchase yours directly at this event.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315228909/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T134822Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T134822Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
