SUMMARY:Getting Started When It’s Hard: A Practical Workshop for Remote 
 Workers
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n## Getting Unstuck: Learn It. Practice It.
  Leave With Momentum.\n\nHave you ever looked at your to-do list\, known e
 xactly what needed to happen next\, and still couldn't get yourself to sta
 rt?\nYou're not lazy. You're not broken. And you're definitely not alone.\
 nWhether you have ADHD\, an ADHD-ish brain\, or you're simply overwhelmed 
 by a task that feels too big\, too stressful\, or too unclear\, this works
 hop will give you practical tools you can use immediately.\nJoin local coa
 ch and consultant Kai Northcott (8 Seasons Consulting) for a hands-on expe
 rience that goes beyond productivity hacks and motivational advice.\n\n###
  Here's what makes this workshop different:\n\nYou'll learn a simple\, rep
 eatable process for getting started on difficult tasks—and then you'll a
 ctually use it.\n**During the first hour\, Kai will guide us through:**\n\
 n* **Why we get stuck**\n* **What our brains are doing when we avoid impor
 tant work**\n* **A practical framework for creating momentum**\n* **Tools 
 for finding motivation without relying on willpower**\n\nYou'll receive a 
 simple visual guide that you can take home and keep at your desk for those
  inevitable "Why can't I just do this?" moments.\n\\***feel free to bring 
 your lunch for this portion.**\n\n### Then we'll put it into practice.\n\n
 Instead of ending with more information\, we'll **spend the next 90 minute
 s working on the very tasks we've been avoiding.**\nBring the project\, em
 ail\, proposal\, decision\, or task that's been hanging over your head.\nY
 ou'll have dedicated time\, supportive accountability\, and a chance to ap
 ply what you've just learned while it's still fresh.\n\n### Finally\, we'l
 l regroup.\n\nFor the last 30 min\, we'll share what worked\, what didn't\
 , and how to make it even easier the next time you're feeling stuck.\n**Le
 arn new tools. Get meaningful work done. Leave with momentum.**\nNo forcin
 g. No shame. No relying on sheer willpower.\nJust practical strategies tha
 t work with your brain—not against it.\n\n## Details\n\n📍 **7 Acres C
 o-Working**\n105 Fairview Road\, Asheville\n🕒 **12:30 PM – 3:30 PM**\
 n**12:30–1:30 PM- feel free to bring your lunch!**\nLearn Kai's practica
 l framework for getting unstuck and starting difficult tasks.\n**1:30–3:
 00 PM**\nPut the tools into practice with 90 minutes of focused work time.
  Bring a project\, task\, decision\, or piece of work you've been avoiding
 .\n**3:00–3:30 PM**\nRegroup for a facilitated debrief to discuss what w
 orked\, what challenged you\, and how to build on your momentum.\n💸 **F
 ree Event**\n👥 **Space is limited** to keep the experience interactive 
 and conversational.\n**Bring:** Your laptop\, a notebook\, and your list o
 f things you've been putting off that you'd like to make progress on.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315287507/
